  {
   "id": "codex/space_marines/rites_of_war/pride_of_the_chapter",
   "name": "Pride of the Chapter",
   "page": 32,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/pride_of_the_chapter/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "space_marines"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 2 Veteran Squad units.\n- All Troops choices in your army must have the Terminator or Veteran keyword.\n- If your Warlord is slain, you lose D3 Victory Points at the end of the game.\n\nBenefits\n\n- Any unit with the Terminator or Veteran Keywords may be taken as Troops choices instead of as their regular choice.\n- You may select one Space Marine Infantry or Bike unit that does not have the Veteran keyword to include in your army. It gains the Veteran keyword.\n- Any unit that can draw visibility to your warlord or their attached unit may use the Warlord's Leadership (LD) characteristic instead of their own for Pinning and Panic tests.",
   "restrictions": [
